OL,3,ASteve Irwin's family celebrates
OL,4,A'superhero' dad, 20 years after shock
OL,5,Adeath
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian conservationist Bindi Irwin
OL,8,Fhas marked the 20th anniversary of her
OL,9,Ffamous father's death with a touching
OL,10,Ftribute to the man best known as the
OL,11,F"Crocodile Hunter".
OL,13,FSteve Irwin died on 4 September 2006,
OL,14,Faged 44, after a stingray fatally
OL,15,Fpierced his chest while he was
OL,16,Funderwater filming a documentary at the
OL,17,FGreat Barrier Reef.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
